at the marker, walk along the path until you meet him. Loot the Amulet of Spirits from the Nameless Prophet in the outer caves. Use it on each Khan's spirit (Spirit of Kolk, and so on) to make the Khan appear, then kill him and loot his gem: Kolk, Gelk and Magra in the outer caves (outside the instance), Maraudos in the purple wing and Veng in the orange wing of the instance. Use a gem to combine the five gems with the amulet into the Amulet of Union.",rw="1g 40s",ri={"Mark of the Chosen"},xp=10650,sh=false,use={17757},conf={"fdj","zygor"}}
