ns.Q[7029]={n="Vyletongue Corruption",nf="La corruption de Vylelangue",l=47,r=41,fa="Horde",d="Maraudon",ds={"Maraudon"},role="main",s={m=1443,x=23.2,y=70.2,n="Vark Battlescar"},f={m=1443,x=23.2,y=70.3,n="Vark Battlescar"},st="Vark Battlescar, Shadowprey Village, Desolace",ft="Vark Battlescar, Shadowprey Village, Desolace",o={{k="item",n="Filled Cerulean Vial",c=1,ins=false,unk=false,ns=false,near=true,w={m=1443,x=33.2,y=65.7,n="Maraudon Orange Crystal Pool"}},{k="kill",n="Noxxious Scion",c=8,ins=false,unk=true,ns=false,after=1,t={"Noxxious Scion"}}},oe="Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon. Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge. Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village.",of="Remplir la Fiole céruléenne renforcée, au Bassin de cristal orange, dans Maraudon.\n\nEn faire usage sur les Vignes de Vylevrille pour forcer les Engeances de Noxxious corrompues à en sortir.\n\nSoigner 8 plantes en tuant les Engeances de Noxxious, puis retourner voir Vark Battlescar, à Proie-de-l'Ombre.",ne="Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in the outer caves (outside the instance, by the orange entrance), then use it on Vylestem Vines inside (orange side) and kill the Noxxious Scions to heal 8 plants.",ri={"Woodseed Hoop","Sagebrush Girdle","Branchclaw Gauntlets"},rc=true,xp=10250,sh=false,use={17693,17696}}
