ns.Q[7668]={n="The Darkreaver Menace",nf="La menace de Ravassombre",l=60,r=58,c="SHAMAN",fa="Horde",d="Scholomance",ds={"Scholomance"},role="main",p={7667},s={m=1454,x=38.4,y=36,n="Sagorne Creststrider"},f={m=1454,x=38.7,y=35.9,n="Sagorne Creststrider"},st="Sagorne Creststrider, Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar",ft="Sagorne Creststrider, Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar",o={{k="item",n="Darkreaver's Head",c=1,ins=false,unk=true,ns=false,t={"Death Knight Darkreaver"},src={{"Death Knight Darkreaver",100}}}},oe="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him. Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.",of="Servez-vous du Clairvoyant au centre du sous-sol du Grand ossuaire de la Scholomance. Cela attirera des esprits que vous devrez combattre. Les vaincre fera apparaître le Chevalier de la mort Ravassombre. Tuez-le.\n\nRamenez la Tête de Ravassombre à Sagorne Crestrider de la vallée de la Sagesse, à Orgrimmar.",ne="Shaman quest. Clear Rattlegore's basement, use the scryer and defeat Death Knight Darkreaver; return his head.",ri={"Helm of Latent Power"},xp=19900,sh=false}
